  {
   "path": "SCENE.md",
   "role": "instructions",
   "content": "# Focus Pull Headline\n\nA rack focus between two lines of text. A small context line starts sharp while the headline is a heavy blur; the focus pulls, the headline resolves to sharp and the context line drifts out of focus and dims. A thin accent line draws under the headline once it lands. Not a scene transition (see focus-pull) and not a single-text reveal (see focus-blur-resolve).\n\nCategory: typography. Length: 5 s. WebGL: no.\n\nUse when:\n- An opening line where a question or setup gives way to the answer: the context line first, then the headline.\n- A calm, premium headline for a product or a shop.\n\nAvoid when:\n- A fast punchy hook: use beat-title-cards.\n- Changing between two scenes: use focus-pull.\n\nVariables:\n- secondary (string): Context line, default \"Lagi cari camilan malam?\"\n- headline (string): Headline, default \"Dapur Rina buka sampai jam 11\"\n- blur_amount (number, 10-80): Blur, default 36\n- bg_color (color): Background, default \"#ffffff\"\n- main_color (color): Main colour, default \"#2563eb\"\n- text_color (color): Text colour, default \"#0a0a0a\"\n- muted_color (color): Muted colour, default \"#737373\"\n- font_family (string): Font, default \"Geist\"\n- transparent (boolean): Transparent, default false\n\nSource: Mosio original. Licence: MIT. The scene file keeps the upstream notice.\n"
  },
  {
   "path": "scene.html",
   "role": "source",
   "content": "<!doctype html>\n<!--\n  Focus Pull Headline\n\n  A rack focus between two lines of text. A small context line starts sharp while the headline is a heavy blur; the focus pulls, the headline resolves to sharp and the context line drifts out of focus and dims. A thin accent line draws under the headline once it lands. Not a scene transition (see focus-pull) and not a single-text reveal (see focus-blur-resolve).\n\n  An original usemosio/blocks block (MIT, see LICENSE).\n-->\n<html\n  lang=\"en\"\n  data-composition-id=\"focus-pull-headline\"\n  data-composition-duration=\"5\"\n  data-composition-variables='[\n  {\n    \"id\": \"secondary\",\n    \"type\": \"string\",\n    \"role\": \"content\",\n    \"label\": \"Context line\",\n    \"description\": \"Small line that starts in focus and then falls out of it.\",\n    \"default\": \"Lagi cari camilan malam?\"\n  },\n  {\n    \"id\": \"headline\",\n    \"type\": \"string\",\n    \"role\": \"content\",\n    \"label\": \"Headline\",\n    \"description\": \"The line that pulls into focus. Wraps to two or three lines.\",\n    \"default\": \"Dapur Rina buka sampai jam 11\"\n  },\n  {\n    \"id\": \"blur_amount\",\n    \"type\": \"number\",\n    \"role\": \"motion\",\n    \"label\": \"Blur\",\n    \"description\": \"Heavy blur of the out-of-focus line, in pixels at 1080 wide.\",\n    \"default\": 36,\n    \"min\": 10,\n    \"max\": 80,\n    \"step\": 1,\n    \"unit\": \"px\"\n  },\n  {\n    \"id\": \"bg_color\",\n    \"type\": \"color\",\n    \"role\": \"style\",\n    \"label\": \"Background\",\n    \"description\": \"Background.\",\n    \"default\": \"#ffffff\"\n  },\n  {\n    \"id\": \"main_color\",\n    \"type\": \"color\",\n    \"role\": \"style\",\n    \"label\": \"Main colour\",\n    \"description\": \"The line drawn under the headline: the one accent.\",\n    \"default\": \"#2563eb\"\n  },\n  {\n    \"id\": \"text_color\",\n    \"type\": \"color\",\n    \"role\": \"style\",\n    \"label\": \"Text colour\",\n    \"description\": \"Headline.\",\n    \"default\": \"#0a0a0a\"\n  },\n  {\n    \"id\": \"muted_color\",\n    \"type\": \"color\",\n    \"role\": \"style\",\n    \"label\": \"Muted colour\",\n    \"description\": \"Context line.\",\n    \"default\": \"#737373\"\n  },\n  {\n    \"id\": \"font_family\",\n    \"type\": \"string\",\n    \"role\": \"style\",\n    \"label\": \"Font\",\n    \"description\": \"Google Fonts family name; Geist is loaded, others only if the host loads them.\",\n    \"default\": \"Geist\"\n  },\n  {\n    \"id\": \"transparent\",\n    \"type\": \"boolean\",\n    \"role\": \"style\",\n    \"label\": \"Transparent\",\n    \"description\": \"Leave the background clear so the block sits over your own scene.\",\n    \"default\": false\n  }\n]'\n>\n  <head>\n    <meta charset=\"UTF-8\" />\n    <title>Focus Pull Headline</title>\n  </head>\n  <body>\n    <template>\n      <link\n        rel=\"stylesheet\"\n        href=\"https://fonts.googleapis.com/css2?family=Geist:wght@400;500;600;700&amp;display=block\"\n      />\n      <style>\n        #root {\n          position: absolute; inset: 0; overflow: hidden; container-type: size; pointer-events: none;\n          -webkit-font-smoothing: antialiased;\n          background: var(--fph-bg); color: var(--fph-text); font-family: var(--fph-font);\n        }\n        #root * { box-sizing: border-box; }\n        .fph-stage { position: absolute; inset: 0; --u: calc(100cqmin / 1080); }\n\n        .fph-col { position: absolute; inset: 0; display: flex; flex-direction: column; align-items: center; justify-content: center; padding: 0 7cqw; gap: calc(var(--u) * 44); text-align: center; }\n        .fph-sec { font-weight: 500; color: var(--fph-muted); letter-spacing: -0.01em; }\n        .fph-head { font-weight: 600; letter-spacing: -0.055em; line-height: 1.02; text-wrap: balance; }\n        .fph-rule { height: calc(var(--u) * 8); border-radius: calc(var(--u) * 4); background: var(--fph-main); transform-origin: 0 50%; margin-top: calc(var(--u) * 8); }\n\n      </style>\n\n      <div id=\"root\" data-composition-id=\"focus-pull-headline\" data-duration=\"5\" data-fps=\"30\">\n        <div id=\"fph-clip\" class=\"fph-stage clip\" data-start=\"0\" data-duration=\"5\" data-track-index=\"0\">\n          <div class=\"fph-col\"><div class=\"fph-sec\" id=\"fph-sec\"></div><div class=\"fph-head\" id=\"fph-head\"></div><div class=\"fph-rule\" id=\"fph-rule\"></div></div>\n        </div>\n\n        <script src=\"https://cdn.jsdelivr.net/npm/gsap@3.14.2/dist/gsap.min.js\"></script>\n        <script>\n          (function () {\n            \"use strict\";\n            var root = document.getElementById(\"root\");\n            var vars = window.__hyperframes && window.__hyperframes.getVariables ? window.__hyperframes.getVariables() || {} : {};\n            function num(v, d, a, b) { var n = Number(v); return Number.isFinite(n) ? Math.min(b, Math.max(a, n)) : d; }\n            function str(v, d) { return typeof v === \"string\" && v.trim() ? v : d; }\n            function colr(v, d) { return typeof v === \"string\" && v.trim() && window.CSS && CSS.supports(\"color\", v.trim()) ? v.trim() : d; }\n            function bool(v, d) { return v === true || v === \"true\" ? true : v === false || v === \"false\" ? false : d; }\n            function el(tag, cls, parent, html) { var e = document.createElement(tag); if (cls) e.className = cls; if (html !== undefined) e.innerHTML = html; if (parent) parent.appendChild(e); return e; }\n            function esc(s) { return String(s).replace(/&/g, \"&amp;\").replace(/</g, \"&lt;\"); }\n            function lines(v, d) { var s = typeof v === \"string\" && v.trim() ? v : d; return s.split(/\\r?\\n/).map(function (l) { return l.trim(); }).filter(Boolean); }\n            function dots(n) { return String(Math.round(n)).replace(/\\B(?=(\\d{3})+(?!\\d))/g, \".\"); }\n            function ease(n, a, b) { return Math.min(1, Math.max(0, (n - a) / (b - a))); }\n            var W = root.clientWidth || 1080, H = root.clientHeight || 1920, U = Math.min(W, H) / 1080, PORTRAIT = H > W;\n            var PAL = [[\"bg\", \"bg_color\", \"#ffffff\"], [\"main\", \"main_color\", \"#2563eb\"], [\"text\", \"text_color\", \"#0a0a0a\"], [\"muted\", \"muted_color\", \"#737373\"]];\n            PAL.forEach(function (c) { root.style.setProperty(\"--fph-\" + c[0], colr(vars[c[1]], c[2])); });\n            root.style.setProperty(\"--fph-font\", '\"' + str(vars.font_family, \"Geist\") + '\", Geist, system-ui, sans-serif');\n            if (bool(vars.transparent, false)) root.style.background = \"transparent\";\n\n\n            var sec = document.getElementById(\"fph-sec\"), head = document.getElementById(\"fph-head\"), rule = document.getElementById(\"fph-rule\");\n            var st = typeof vars.secondary === \"string\" ? vars.secondary.trim() : \"Lagi cari camilan malam?\";\n            sec.textContent = st; if (!st) sec.style.display = \"none\";\n            head.textContent = str(vars.headline, \"Dapur Rina buka sampai jam 11\");\n            sec.style.fontSize = (PORTRAIT ? 54 : 56) * U + \"px\"; head.style.fontSize = (PORTRAIT ? 150 : 170) * U + \"px\";\n            head.style.maxWidth = (PORTRAIT ? 920 : 1500) * U + \"px\";\n            rule.style.width = (PORTRAIT ? 240 : 260) * U + \"px\";\n            var B = num(vars.blur_amount, 36, 10, 80) * U, hb = { b: B, s: 1.05 }, sb = { b: 0 };\n            function dh() { head.style.filter = \"blur(\" + hb.b.toFixed(2) + \"px)\"; head.style.transform = \"scale(\" + hb.s.toFixed(4) + \")\"; }\n            function ds() { sec.style.filter = \"blur(\" + sb.b.toFixed(2) + \"px)\"; }\n            var tl = gsap.timeline({ paused: true });\n            tl.fromTo(head, { opacity: 0 }, { opacity: 0.5, duration: 0.5, ease: \"power2.out\" }, 0.1);\n            tl.fromTo(sec, { opacity: 0, y: 16 * U }, { opacity: 1, y: 0, duration: 0.5, ease: \"power3.out\" }, 0.1);\n            tl.to(hb, { b: 0, s: 1, duration: 1.4, ease: \"power3.inOut\", onUpdate: dh }, 1.0);\n            tl.to(head, { opacity: 1, duration: 1.2, ease: \"power2.inOut\" }, 1.0);\n            tl.to(sb, { b: 16 * U, duration: 1.2, ease: \"power2.inOut\", onUpdate: ds }, 1.0);\n            tl.to(sec, { opacity: 0.3, scale: 0.96, duration: 1.2, ease: \"power2.inOut\" }, 1.0);\n            tl.fromTo(rule, { scaleX: 0 }, { scaleX: 1, duration: 0.6, ease: \"power2.inOut\" }, 2.5);\n            dh(); ds();\n\n            var total = parseFloat(root.dataset.duration || \"5\");\n            if (tl.duration() < total) tl.to({}, { duration: total - tl.duration() });\n            tl.seek(0);\n            window.__timelines = window.__timelines || {};\n            window.__timelines[\"focus-pull-headline\"] = tl;\n          })();\n        </script>\n      </div>\n    </template>\n  </body>\n</html>\n"
  }
 ],
